  "body": "[pc.close](http://w3c.github.io/webrtc-pc/#widl-RTCPeerConnection-close-void) says this about the ICE agent:\n\n> - Destroy connection's ICE Agent, abruptly ending any active ICE processing and any active streaming, and releasing any relevant resources (e.g. TURN permissions).\n\nand that is all it says. It needs to [update the ICE connection state](http://w3c.github.io/webrtc-pc/#update-ice-connection-state) to `\"closed\"`, but do so synchronously, and without firing any events.\n",
